        <mxCell id="rUiTRf6WLeN2Ys5AsI-e-65" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;" value="- Security Groups: ALB allows 80/443 from Internet; App SG allows 80 from ALB; DB SG allows 3306 from App SG.&lt;br&gt;- AZ Failover: Multi-AZ deployment ensures high availability; RDS standby and ALB handle automatic failover if an AZ fails.&lt;br&gt;- Scaling: EC2 Auto Scaling dynamically adjusts instance count based on CloudWatch metrics.&lt;br&gt;- Cost Optimization: Using single NAT Gateway per AZ (or shared) and right-sized instances to manage AWS costs." vertex="1">
